      "side": 1,
      "message": "The server doesn\u0027t remove mapped at creation because it uses that when available to initialize the buffer. So it may happen that the server returns nullptr when the client doesn\u0027t. IDK how we should handle that case. Create an unnecessay error buffer on the wire side and ignore all mapping stuff?",
